 <div class="meta"><span class="status">SEMANTIC L3 · DESIGN PROBABLE · OPERATIONAL POTENTIAL</span><p><b>Purpose:</b> Define the complete design classes of Benefits and Assets and the SMART evidence chain from Strategy through outcome to persistent value.</p><p><b>Owns:</b> Benefit identity, beneficiary, baseline, target, measure, attribution, state, realisation decision and Asset conversion class.</p><p><b>Does not own:</b> Service delivery activity, output completion, Pattern admission or operational transaction records.</p><p><b>Boundary:</b> design definitions and instance taxonomies only. Odoo remains operational truth. No operational metrics or mutable record detail is duplicated here.</p></div>
